            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>In a surgical robot (1), a pivot position teaching button (85) is pressed with a tip end of a medical device (4) moved to a position corresponding to an insertion position of a trocar (T) inserted into a body surface (S) of a patient (P) such that a pivot position (PP) is stored in a storage.</p>
